[00:00.52]Lesson 29 | 第29课
[00:03.33]Come in, Amy. | 进来,艾米。
[00:06.85]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.60]How must Amy clean the floor? | 艾米必须怎样打扫地板?
[00:17.30]Come in, Amy. | 进来,艾米。
[00:19.85]Shut the door, please. | 请把门关上。
[00:22.49]This bedroom's very untidy. | 这间卧室非常不整洁。
[00:26.83]What must I do, Mrs. Jones? | 我该做什么,琼斯太太?
[00:30.53]Open the window and air the room. | 打开窗户,让房间通通风。
[00:34.92]Then put these clothes in the wardrobe. | 然后把这些衣服放进衣柜里。
[00:39.69]Then make the bed. | 然后铺床。
[00:42.81]Dust the dressing table. | 擦一下梳妆台。
[00:45.85]Then sweep the floor. | 然后扫一下地板。